<title>USA: International Paper Q3 shr $0.37 vs $1.27.</title>
<headline>International Paper Q3 shr $0.37 vs $1.27.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>9/30/96		  9/30/95</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.37		    $1.27</p>
<p> Net		 111,000		  328,000</p>
<p> Sales	     5,100,000		5,100,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  300,000		  258,700</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.06		    $3.49</p>
<p> Net		 308,000		  890,000</p>
<p> Sales	     15,000,000	     14,700,000</p>
