<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is International Paper</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said earnings-per-share amounts were adjusted for a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The company said earnings for the nine months ended September 30, 1996 included a $515 million pre-tax restructuring charge ($362 million after taxes of $1.35 per share) and a $592 million pre-tax gain ($336 million after taxes and minority interest expenses or $1.25 per share) on the sale of an interest in a west coast partnership.</p>
